  "subtitle": "Topic: Perplexity · Subject: Natural Language Processing · Three beginner, two medium and two advanced questions, seven original educational diagrams and a tested next-token Python calculation.",
  "diagramStyle": "diagrams/perplexity.css",
  "hero": "<section class=\"ppl-hero\"><span class=\"ppl-kicker\">PERPLEXITY · VISUAL STUDY</span><h2>How well does a language model predict the next token?</h2><p>Perplexity summarizes the probabilities assigned to observed text. Learn the formula, work through a calculation, compare evaluation protocols, and discover what the metric cannot tell you.</p><div class=\"ppl-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"ppl-title-0 ppl-desc-0\"><title id=\"ppl-title-0\">How surprising are the actual next tokens?</title><desc id=\"ppl-desc-0\">Autoregressive context The kitten followed by observed slept, with a distribution that assigns slept probability 0.5, played 0.25 and jumped 0.125.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"37\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#288878\" font-weight=\"850\">PERPLEXITY · NLP VISUAL STUDY</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#2f556a\" font-weight=\"850\">How surprising are the actual next tokens?</text><rect x=\"28\" y=\"112\" width=\"944\" height=\"266\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d8e6ea\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#4d7f94\" font-weight=\"850\">A LANGUAGE MODEL PREDICTS WHAT COMES NEXT</text><rect x=\"52\" y=\"173\" width=\"263\" height=\"120\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"#eaf8fc\" stroke=\"#d6e5e9\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"183.5\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#4b94b1\" font-weight=\"850\">CONTEXT</text><text x=\"183.5\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#507584\" font-weight=\"685\">The kitten ...</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"237\" x2=\"362\" y2=\"237\" stroke=\"#6795a6\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><path d=\"M352 229 L362 237 L352 245\" stroke=\"#6795a6\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"374\" y=\"166\" width=\"281\" height=\"133\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ebf8f2\" stroke=\"#d5e6dd\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"391\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#329d8b\" font-weight=\"850\">NEXT-TOKEN PROBABILITY</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#3c7184\" font-weight=\"720\">slept</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"214\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e3eef0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"465\" y=\"214\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#329d8b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"638\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#4b7182\" font-weight=\"730\">50.0%</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#3c7184\" font-weight=\"720\">played</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"241\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e3eef0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"465\" y=\"241\" width=\"70.5\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4b94b1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"638\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#4b7182\" font-weight=\"730\">25.0%</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"279\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#3c7184\" font-weight=\"720\">jumped</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"268\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e3eef0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"465\" y=\"268\" width=\"35.25\" height=\"17\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#4b94b1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"638\" y=\"281\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#4b7182\" font-weight=\"730\">12.5%</text><line x1=\"661\" y1=\"237\" x2=\"708\" y2=\"237\" stroke=\"#6795a6\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><path d=\"M698 229 L708 237 L698 245\" stroke=\"#6795a6\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"721\" y=\"172\" width=\"223\" height=\"122\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff2e8\" stroke=\"#eddccc\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"739\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#b47c55\" font-weight=\"850\">OBSERVED TOKEN</text><text x=\"739\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ad764e\" font-weight=\"850\">&quot;slept&quot;</text><text x=\"739\" y=\"274\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#617a86\" font-weight=\"695\">Loss = −ln(0.5)</text><text x=\"57\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#507786\" font-weight=\"730\">Perplexity summarizes observed-token probability over a full held-out sequence.</text></svg></div><p class=\"ppl-note\">All probabilities in the diagrams are teaching examples; they are not measurements from a live LLM.</p></section>",
